  "steps": [
    "Marinate the chicken: mix the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, paprika, oregano, cumin, salt and pepper in a bowl. Coat the chicken well and marinate at least 20 to 30 minutes, or overnight for deeper flavor.",
    "Cook the rice: rinse the rice and cook it with the water, olive oil and salt. Once done, fluff with a fork and set aside.",
    "Grill the chicken: heat a grill pan or skillet over medium heat. Cook the chicken about 5 to 6 minutes per side, until fully cooked and slightly charred. Let it rest, then slice.",
    "Prepare the dressing: whisk together the olive oil, lemon juice, Dijon mustard, honey, garlic, salt and pepper until smooth.",
    "Assemble the bowl: start with a base of rice, then add the sliced chicken, tomatoes, cucumber, red onion, olives and feta cheese.",
    "Drizzle with the dressing and sprinkle fresh herbs on top. Serve immediately."
  ],
